{
  "_notes": [
    "Three kinds of source feed one dashboard, grouped by 'section'.",
    "ebay_searches: official eBay UK Browse API. type = car | scooter | goods.",
    "feeds: any RSS URL. Use for CamelCamelCamel price-drop feeds and HotUKDeals keyword feeds.",
    "  - CamelCamelCamel: make a public Amazon wishlist of your kit, import it at camelcamelcamel.com, then copy the RSS URL it gives you into a feed below.",
    "  - HotUKDeals: search a keyword on hotukdeals.com and grab the RSS link for that search; one feed per keyword.",
    "Facebook / Gumtree / Preloved / Vinted / Enviromate have no API. Set up a SAVED SEARCH on each,",
    "  send the alert emails to a Gmail label (default name 'forecourt'), and the watcher reads that label via IMAP.",
    "  See the README for the 3-step email setup."
  ],

